790 0 obj
  << /ActualText (EXPERIENCE\nVisual Designer \024 Web \046 Digital\050LUMO Entertainment LLC\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000        Remote \267 Aug 2026 \023 Present\nDesign and maintain the company\031s public\055facing website across music\054 art\054 media\054 and artist development projects\054 creating clear and cohesive digital experiences\056\nBuild responsive layouts in ZenBusiness\054 refining typography\054 imagery\054 spacing\054 and content hierarchy across desktop and mobile while organizing project materials into structured web content\056\nDeveloped initial visual references and concept directions for the In Between interview series\054 with selected elements carried into the final promotional design\056\n\nGame Testing Intern\050Punkcode Technology Hong Kong Limited\000\000          Jul 2025 \023 Aug 2025\nConducted playtesting and documented gameplay bugs\054 usability issues\054 and unclear interactions for a block puzzle game\056\nAnalyzed 184 pieces of player feedback and delivered an optimization report with a 65\045 recommendation adoption rate\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 791 0 R
     /Pg 780 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
